- H. Wu, Z. Zhao, and Z. Wang, “META-Unet: Multi-Scale Efficient Transformer Attention Unet for Fast and High-Accuracy Polyp Segmentation,” *IEEE Transactions on Automation Science and Engineering*, vol. 21, no. 3, pp. 4117–4128, 2024.
